Monitor comparator: trip points from a slow triangle ramp (serdes_cmp)
* Bias: the real bandgap reference (serdes_bias_ref) and one serdes_bias_pcopy finger (2.5 uA) into ib.
* inn = Vn (common mode); inp = inn + a triangle ramp (PWL); out is the CMOS output.
.lib "@MODEL_LIBRARY@" @SECTION@
.include "@PROJECT_ROOT@/analog/common/devices/spice/sky130_primitives.spice"
.include "@PROJECT_ROOT@/analog/common/devices/spice/sky130_pfet_lvt.spice"
.include "@PROJECT_ROOT@/analog/common/devices/spice/cmos_logic.spice"
.include "@PROJECT_ROOT@/analog/common/bias/spice/bandgap.spice"
.include "@PROJECT_ROOT@/analog/common/bias/spice/bias_dist.spice"
.include "@PROJECT_ROOT@/analog/common/monitor/spice/monitor.spice"
Vdd vdd 0 @SUPPLY@
Xref vbg i0 i1 i2 i3 vgi vdd 0 serdes_bias_ref
Vi0 i0 0 0.7
Vi1 i1 0 0.7
Vi2 i2 0 0.7
Vi3 i3 0 0.7
Xcp ib vgi vdd serdes_bias_pcopy n=@NCOPY@
Vmeas vdd vddm 0
Xc inp inn out ib vddm 0 serdes_cmp @CMP_PARAMS@
Vn inn 0 0.9
Vd inp inn PWL(@PWL@)
.nodeset v(vbg)=1.23 v(xref.xbg.s)=1.23 v(xref.vg)=0.9 v(vgi)=0.9 v(xref.xbg.ta)=0.95 v(xref.xbg.tb)=0.95
.temp @TEMP_C@
.options reltol=1e-5 abstol=1p vntol=1u
